# A Settings tab (Chromium's own page) shown again after a relaunch opens fresh at its address:
# putting its saved back/forward list back crashed Cra as the page was made (Cra.restoreHistory).
cra://open?url=chrome://settings/searchEngines
wait 4
expect-log opens a page for settings
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=other
wait 4
relaunch
wait 3
cra://action/nextTab
wait 2
cra://action/previousTab
wait 4
expect-log loaded settings
